                "text": "MEDICAID EXPANSION: Along with Senator Warnock, I\u2019m fighting to expand Medicaid NOW through our Medicaid Saves Lives Act. Our neighbors, friends, and families are suffering with high medical bills, and we need to expand Medicaid to cut costs.",
