                "text": "Through my Medicaid Saves Lives Act, I'm leading the fight to #ExpandMedicaidNOW. \n\nThis is one of the reasons I ran for Congress. I've heard too many stories of people in my district suffering because they can't see a doctor. We have to expand Medicaid in GA and across the U.S.",
